Article 2 (Persons Eligible for Medal, etc.) The PyeongChang Winter Olympic and Paralympic Games Medal (hereinafter referred to as the "Medal") shall be awarded to military personnel, police officials, fire officials, and volunteers who performed any of the following duties for at least 10 days at competition-related facilities under subparagraph 2 of Article 2 of the Special Act on Support for the 2018 PyeongChang Winter Olympic and Paralympic Games, the Organizing Committee for the 2018 PyeongChang Winter Olympic and Paralympic Games, or other areas necessary for safe operation of the Games:
1. Security and guard duties for the Games;
2. Fire prevention, rescue, emergency medical services, and other firefighting duties for the Games;
3. Support duties concerning preparation and operation of the Games.
